        "message": "ci: capture and upload the test log on failure\n\nDownloading workflow logs through the GitHub API requires admin rights on the\nrepository, so a failing CI run was undebuggable from outside. The suite\noutput is now written to ci-test-output.log and uploaded as an artifact when\nthe run fails. The exit code is propagated explicitly so a piped run still\nfails the job.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
